<ac:structured-macro ac:name="info" ac:schema-version="1" ac:local-id="0365b2f1-eeca-4f4a-8f7e-b5f85349651d" ac:macro-id="9eba6218-3a5d-422d-849f-806f6a58e88d"><ac:rich-text-body><p local-id="7bfdce8c-d58a-498d-8dc9-f45e61ba5e6a">Demo hub page designed for the Drafts area. This page showcases formatting, standard macros, and links to demo-only subpages. All names are neutral and self-contained.</p></ac:rich-text-body></ac:structured-macro><h2 local-id="0b025cad-626f-42b1-acdc-727072b282e7">Overview</h2><p local-id="3f962040-6078-48ea-aa66-9dcf3fbd1548">Use this page as a living demo of how to structure drafts with rich formatting, macros, and clear navigation. Everything here is safe to reuse, adapt, and duplicate for internal experiments.</p><h2 local-id="83f5a8e2-8ba1-48ab-bf00-01177a189ae0">Quick Navigation</h2><ul local-id="7b156a9f-b086-4de8-8a7c-b77b24fe460d"><li local-id="52e31804-0009-4461-8f3c-40b6256aec41"><p local-id="49471522-8d41-4b19-87a0-a9ee0cfaa384">Demo Subpage: <a href="https://demo.local/wiki/spaces/DEMO/pages/1001/Demo+Requirements">https://demo.local/wiki/spaces/DEMO/pages/1001/Demo+Requirements</a> (requirements outline)</p></li><li local-id="bbd4f4b3-d51c-46e1-9ff0-3aa84dd877c7"><p local-id="f939b7f4-bd7e-4b57-963e-fc3e488edf42">Demo Subpage: <a href="https://demo.local/wiki/spaces/DEMO/pages/1002/Demo+Project+Plan">https://demo.local/wiki/spaces/DEMO/pages/1002/Demo+Project+Plan</a> (milestones and timeline)</p></li><li local-id="c5bd5fce-06ae-41ab-9abc-5da63b6321c6"><p local-id="1e51b30a-e5de-4ad3-a085-258a785758af">Demo Subpage: <a href="https://demo.local/wiki/spaces/DEMO/pages/1003/Demo+Decision+Log">https://demo.local/wiki/spaces/DEMO/pages/1003/Demo+Decision+Log</a> (key decisions and context)</p></li></ul><ac:adf-extension><ac:adf-node type="panel"><ac:adf-attribute key="panel-type">note</ac:adf-attribute><ac:adf-attribute key="local-id">f9e85f35-fe6a-4eb9-b7f1-63970313924e</ac:adf-attribute><ac:adf-content><p local-id="3fdeadb3-51f7-4dd9-a517-10eb7b932640">Tip: Keep demo content fully scoped. Do not add external links or references. Duplicate these pages to create more examples as needed.</p></ac:adf-content></ac:adf-node><ac:adf-fallback><div class="panel conf-macro output-block" style="background-color: rgb(234,230,255);border-color: rgb(153,141,217);border-width: 1.0px;"><div class="panelContent" style="background-color: rgb(234,230,255);">
