</div></div></ac:adf-fallback></ac:adf-extension><h2 local-id="d223d884-004b-4a5e-acae-fd6846f9b210">Highlights</h2><ol start="1" local-id="6c272f82-b73e-4216-91c5-c24b1c24cee5"><li local-id="56f5498e-24a4-4934-af21-376d960aa606"><p local-id="e270b6b1-2b90-4218-8904-5759fd38a696">Macro-friendly layout featuring status, decisions, and callouts</p></li><li local-id="39c8933d-2269-4eac-8f11-8cffa1359047"><p local-id="20538260-3f9e-421c-8e63-c301ca36d8ea">Clear subpage navigation with inline cards for easy discovery</p></li><li local-id="14184d21-9952-44e7-8b66-0f4e44c1a9d1"><p local-id="bc8fd70b-ed1a-46c9-ad13-f8aa8e78bc6c">Neutral naming and demo-only scope to avoid external dependencies</p></li></ol><h2 local-id="f1dfd30e-7d53-41a2-ade8-55ebc9e85015">Status Summary</h2><table data-table-width="760" data-layout="default" ac:local-id="672f6958-7d72-4157-bec9-47eb310b291f"><tbody><tr ac:local-id="d09fcc29-2e6e-49dd-b69c-348ef677d556"><th ac:local-id="44ed95b0-174d-46f4-a4cc-fb12aebf197d"><p local-id="6e5532be-6716-4a2f-a585-31c605a20ed4"><strong>Item</strong></p></th><th ac:local-id="e18daa79-4d57-4404-a521-3b9caafe8207"><p local-id="27d20bfd-4f47-4b44-b525-1eacd364bdbd"><strong>Owner</strong></p></th><th ac:local-id="317fe237-f95a-4abd-8008-8b562a5f3552"><p local-id="d21b4a6c-4a80-4da8-88e2-a63afdd56993"><strong>Status</strong></p></th><th ac:local-id="fa4f9408-aabc-4aa3-8a4e-6c13ea85695c"><p local-id="d7dcfd35-fab2-4ecf-8b19-e705fd8e01e0"><strong>Target Date</strong></p></th></tr><tr ac:local-id="fd3da27d-27ab-4e8d-9305-4dbbeee66bc2"><td ac:local-id="ce791934-2a21-493a-97e7-09a19c705abd"><p local-id="8fa01fa0-11c0-4dab-b45f-bcc1c562cf4e">Draft hub structure</p></td><td ac:local-id="135de1ea-2ee8-4ed1-8f4e-bc58c0b12e74"><p local-id="1b2a81d1-ea6b-4558-89ba-e8c0cc5277d0">[Add Content Owner]</p></td><td ac:local-id="a3d73aa0-f88a-484b-9de6-78c744b6bc31"><p local-id="f227133c-952b-4b98-8230-4bdb035d2a61">In Review</p></td><td ac:local-id="18d611df-ee6d-42f3-aba7-bfec6c1c6