</ac:task-list><h2 local-id="fd056443-16f6-40a7-9643-287ced3a3375">Demo Accordion</h2><ac:structured-macro ac:name="expand" ac:schema-version="1" data-layout="wide" ac:local-id="822c352e-19f3-4b58-8ebe-57cbe9c7fa28" ac:macro-id="2bc30a68-484e-4849-af0a-81c9cfa77fdf"><ac:parameter ac:name="breakoutWidth">760</ac:parameter><ac:rich-text-body><p local-id="03e7e37e-fb5f-488b-a491-b05a64659a89">Use this expandable section to tuck away optional details.</p><ul local-id="b0858753-19aa-4d60-9da0-b18a6281be4b"><li local-id="82dce7ea-038e-4d42-90d7-b664b9fa812a"><p local-id="1d89c916-8669-43d5-bc52-f3d3d6bdf6ff">Guidelines: Keep sections short and scannable</p></li><li local-id="1e6ab494-b38b-43e9-93b7-a4a10313149d"><p local-id="cda7b0e1-7c6e-4ab7-bfbd-9a1f6d26af49">Style: Prefer headings, panels, and concise paragraphs</p></li><li local-id="54240fb2-bf8b-4b71-8f50-6d6edc9ccd97"><p local-id="bcb27e10-7507-4edc-8dbd-2c9c1b948f75">Ownership: Assign responsibilities with role-based mentions</p></li></ul></ac:rich-text-body></ac:structured-macro><h2 local-id="468de91c-e042-4628-b787-bfe223dca1ba">Comparison Matrix (Demo)</h2><table data-table-width="760" data-layout="default" ac:local-id="5094b020-113f-4ebf-b70b-19901c8a988f"><tbody><tr ac:local-id="f22899e5-ddda-4c42-9ad2-0982387e5ff6"><th ac:local-id="ac9ab297-7b1f-4658-8f02-4a44278c3407"><p local-id="17ee62e0-bf8b-46af-b690-71c5f54948de"><strong>Option</strong></p></th><th ac:local-id="b7a82fb8-b6a5-41e5-ba55-d66b36daf194"><p local-id="e191032d-32f8-441f-81c1-0122ccc1166c"><strong>Pros</strong></p></th><th ac:local-id="71325ec2-1c11-49e3-8977-c6ab098b4e64"><p local-id="2eeabadb-b9ed-4ce5-9ad9-72f73cc9a741"><strong>Cons</strong></p></th></tr><tr ac:local-id="efc6968f-7788-4ca8-99f4-11b62c433657"><td ac:local-id="faf5b5e7-b32a-4183-8a2b-32e5ecff9afa"><p local-id="c94afb5d-805c-41a0-8d17-b74a7e1f8daa">Structured Template</p></td><td ac:local-id="5ff3fc52-3668-48a4-8545-b250876e7fd1"><p local-id="1667a326-8567-4508-be9f-9b4279a19951" /><ul local-id="f95cb001-c7df-4846-a5ef-fbdc0d054c2f"><li local-id="c4ef8b71-9636-40d0-9542-b4ef7feac681"><p local-id="61b27b4a-573e-4894-8fb5-046f70e73ba8">Consistent layout</p></li><li local-id="3aba66de-1f3f-4825-9627-3b505417f7bb"><p local-id="760bb679-9e63-46dc-a6b3-888ea7758d33">Easy onboarding</p></li></ul></td><td ac:local-id="b3983b4d-b482-4d3e-a3c5-d45b43f94ba8"><p local-id="0001dd2c-517a-4362-82ee-f2225c33936f" /><ul local-id="4f9cb159-2a57-43f0-a357-30e7a741914b"><li local-id="c4d6dd97-871b-4c11-81c6-cf5fc7a6a454"><p local-id="62ef9ec1-91ea-4ebe-9cec-4d442c768bf7">Needs upkeep</p></li><li local-id="218a8704-677e-4be2-b67b-926544204fd7"><p local-id="9f663c2d-c051-4504-a579-59865d9266c4">May feel rigid</p></li></ul></td></tr><tr ac:local-id="8bb3b2e4-8397-4dbe-b532-897092d8aeb4"><td ac:local-id="16346bc7-47cc-404e-aee3-ea9e287ec23a"><p local-id="f5790bca-22d2-4cb0-9ace-acbc65cfa153">Free-form Draft</p></td><td ac:local-id="b4d413e6-9614-4528-bc74-3d7db88e8d12"><p local-id="903f0318-81b0-4890-a6ec-10ed2ef8adcb" /><ul local-id="21abd1d8-790c-4e12-bf5d-8a81c134fdaf"><li local-id="1d2d1b29-0e8d-4523-99ab-a4f117a15e0e"><p local-id="1df3c477-4884-4e3a-9e93-973d1e709a92">Fast to start</p></li><li local-id="ee454c42-8cc8-4c67-9024-eda2d971db51"><p local-id="25a8a37b-5b05-4611-a36f-ae937f396732">Flexible exploration</p></li></ul></td><td ac:local-id="db1f0a8f-b7a5-4a10-ba63-e12c235ce0df"><p local-id="7f97d760-5730-45c6-b914-e323e6759efe" /><ul local-id="08005148-bdc3-40c7-b6d9-8a2e18ae30ca"><li local-id="4277303f-9282-421a-b968-7b3e73ac9d91"><p local-id="1b201373-ee26-4b58-9096-df2e71df35c9">Harder to maintain</p></li><li local-id="cef6e10c-9c54-4251-a8bb-f64ea6a3bac8"><p local-id="4a45c0bd-d341-45d0-855c-adf5445307e2">Inconsistent format</p></li></ul></td></tr></tbody></table><h2 local-id="d3232cbb-43c8-432d-a3be-c2df8b500364">Demo FAQ</h2><ac:structured-macro ac:name="expand" ac:schema-version="1" data-layout="wide" ac:local-id="1e526e10-0497-4c54-a625-eb70b0d3bb6a" ac:macro-id="26d1bb1d-f1d1-4ad7-949e-95859f901e10"><ac:parameter ac:name="breakoutWidth">760</ac:parameter><ac:rich-text-body><p local-id="9abc5434-94b2-48db-9cac-69e65e350c52">How do I duplicate this setup?</p><p local-id="f4631469-e2f9-4342-a667-5ae06f4aeb4c">Create a new parent page under Drafts, copy this content, and update subpage titles. Keep links within the demo space.</p></ac:rich-text-body></ac:structured-macro><ac:structured-macro ac:name="expand" ac:schema-version="1" data-layout="wide" ac:local-id="523cd304-5563-4e3e-bffd-6d6dca0ed20e" ac:macro-id="4c65290f-94ec-40b3-9e30-8c65061f18e5"><ac:parameter ac:name="breakoutWidth">760</ac:parameter><ac:rich-text-body><p local-id="a356089f-2c10-4e63-b57f-07316722b456">Who owns updates?</p><p local-id="f6518612-b789-4d00-8a96-2b3c007f5996">Ownership is assigned to a role, not a person. Example: [Add Content Owner].</p></ac:rich-text-body></ac:structured-macro><h2 local-id="337c3bc8-b1d9-4c3b-9b5e-04bd82d86654">What&rsquo;s on the Demo Subpages?</h2><h3 local-id="f2a6da4c-fc2d-46f5-b482-425903da9b52">Requirements (Demo)</h3><p local-id="d7d39bc4-804b-41b4-893e-fc5cfc87ce63">Purpose: Capture clear scope, non-functional notes, and acceptance criteria using headings, panels, and lists.</p><ul local-id="4c002f17-bcb0-49a4-a4e2-3fb6f5bd3d53"><li local-id="c3088bab-f57e-4f2e-90d3-10d907d839b9"><p local-id="ccb1d29a-1ea7-449b-a03b-e9420a748d14">Scope overview with short problem statement</p></li><li local-id="5a681709-28b8-4aea-b1e4-d441c93a7f89"><p local-id="2c6c01ce-5dbf-49fa-b5b1-c113bfe928b6">Acceptance criteria list using bullets</p></li><li local-id="29bd4f0e-27b3-4941-9677-6ee8c5d32055"><p local-id="d3b63e34-7eb0-41a0-9d6b-39ac765d8458">Risks called out with a warning panel</p></li></ul><h3 local-id="4974e0ca-00f8-4b92-9c39-39af871acebd">Project Plan (Demo)</h3><p local-id="fb617cad-eac2-4c73-ab03-c00129047a3f">Purpose: Show a milestone list with dates using a clean table and an at-a-glance status panel.</p><table data-table-width="760" data-layout="default" ac:local-id="581d166a-5fa0-462c-9fd8-b486f0dd1943"><tbody><tr ac:local-id="d34e5b9f-9dea-44b8-aa2c-7ddd7d926f53"><th ac:local-id="91fbe52c-ff06-46d6-9618-ae8c5b99da44"><p local-id="b84145bb-f884-4379-af77-23b425ef355e"><strong>Milestone</strong></p></th><th ac:local-id="43ccaaf9-77ec-47ad-9cee-adbeb2ced799"><p local-id="285ca3f9-4581-4b74-9f74-843980c01599"><strong>Planned</strong></p></th><th ac:local-id="a0e748cf-4f57-40b2-b25e-3781609ee3f7"><p local-id="d8bda537-cec9-4596-b863-9040d1db7ea4"><strong>Owner</strong></p></th></tr><tr ac:local-id="5abff816-fff0-498d-81fb-498dda188069"><td ac:local-id="6a0157d6-4448-4b8b-8900-e538826f9e3a"><p local-id="429281d4-c164-46e6-bfb8-99a4173ec273">Initial outline ready</p></td><td ac:local-id="b4d5f3fa-e6c9-4715-b667-489f2ffec8dd"><p local-id="2026b1f4-eb7e-45b1-8844-159306486e74"><time datetime="2026-02-10" local-id="a8819489-61ce-40b7-b50c-d0522875d1ac" /></p></td><td ac:local-id="6030f8f1-1195-4ade-b0aa-94c88f7174a2"><p local-id="d2dc71d1-0252-43c9-b485-721bd697b290">[Add Planner]</p></td></tr><tr ac:local-id="5799ebed-5e4a-41f7-a156-0b1b28d3417d"><td ac:local-id="9bd22423-27f6-4c0b-88eb-d477cc5f6611"><p local-id="37e1906c-d13a-49ba-b0e4-ff4a93fd4bb3">Subpages linked and verified</p></td><td ac:local-id="caa64511-e6fa-4fe2-a782-896d4619d2b6"><p local-id="5b8ec1c8-8400-4142-b48a-b13df7989b5b"><time datetime="2026-02-18" local-id="d4da39b4-066e-47ef-9b11-a025091ecfd3" /></p></td><td ac:local-id="99f20e9a-0f1c-4ba9-8c31-b501ab06816a"><p local-id="5b927fa4-d724-45b4-9d9b-eb3d8be1706c">[Add Coordinator]</p></td></tr></tbody></table><h3 local-id="5ce52f6a-983e-4cd0-a82f-ac6b93cda608">Decision Log (Demo)</h3><p local-id="9d928d5f-c6f9-4416-a62c-df380f8d541f">Purpose: Track important choices with rationale and outcomes.</p><table data-table-width="760" data-layout="default" ac:local-id="b3516113-325f-4b19-b60c-62adf7ed7afd"><tbody><tr ac:local-id="2774e0c9-64a0-4647-9461-91ff26072c8f"><th ac:local-id="a06784b9-b03f-49e3-93c3-1daa01f9df6e"><p local-id="de0cfa77-f47f-416b-a357-5fac8636d095"><strong>Decision</strong></p></th><th ac:local-id="0bf1e8a8-1dd3-4e19-8f44-d1dc93b56d3f"><p local-id="dbc63499-0adf-4fef-8b27-9fe0ab918c78"><strong>Context</strong></p></th><th ac:local-id="c6938dc3-6ab6-4025-8399-8710041dea01"><p local-id="ca055cd9-30c3-4ae7-8707-ac57b290b114"><strong>Outcome</strong></p></th></tr><tr ac:local-id="5b391f45-288f-4009-b642-ab816e992cdc"><td ac:local-id="ff81047b-e0ff-4251-b470-1983d22131fd"><p local-id="ee9acefc-c99e-4b33-a489-4329f1c6c81b">Use a neutral naming convention</p></td><td ac:local-id="1d7be85e-db0c-4144-a06b-ea9664d650ed"><p local-id="dbdfaf51-3b91-4688-beb5-d61a558ad44c">Prevents confusion and external references</p></td><td ac:local-id="defb9637-5ebc-4ecc-b9f6-18e4b14212a9"><p local-id="71fca8d1-593f-455e-bc5a-d68437af72dd">Consistent, reusable templates</p></td></tr><tr ac:local-id="5a94adb0-2fe8-419e-a8c5-a70b526acf26"><td ac:local-id="a9bf1e96-69ed-4a14-9ddd-c9bee19ffe82"><p local-id="94ab9a04-69cb-4f68-91a2-910864680fa3">Constrain links to demo pages only</p></td><td ac:local-id="62c618ab-caa6-426a-b35b-bfa7fb0d1166"><p local-id="3c09409d-02bb-4b47-98e3-7ebb2b54a779">Keeps the draft sandboxed</p></td><td ac:local-id="826881cb-e643-4846-9c66-ba12cd3b2d06"><p local-id="ba6343e3-c968-4133-af1b-98fb7ae11856">No external dependencies</p></td></tr></tbody></table>
